completion.text:
I'll build this as a Rhylthyme program for a backyard barbecue with proper resource constraints and parallel tracks.

Let me structure this:
- **Pork track**: smoker prep, heat, smoke unwrapped, wrap, smoke wrapped, hold, pull
- **Beans track**: starts when pork goes to cooler, low simmer
- **Slaw track**: parallel prep and dressing, chill
- **Grill track**: light grill, sausages, corn, buns
- **Service track**: plates/pickles, final layout

Resources: smoker (1), kettle grill (1), side burner (1), cooler (1), cooks (2 actors).

```json
{
  "schemaVersion": "0.3.0-alpha",
  "programId": "backyard-bbq",
  "name": "Backyard Barbecue: Smoker and Grill",
  "description": "Pork shoulder smoked low-and-slow while beans, slaw, and grilled sausages and corn come together for twelve.",
  "environmentType": "kitchen",
  "actors": 2,
  "tracks": [
    {
      "trackId": "pork",
      "name": "Pork Shoulder",
      "steps": [
        {
          "stepId": "light_smoker",
          "name": "Light smoker and bring to 250°F",
          "task": "smoker",
          "duration": { "type": "fixed", "seconds": 2700 },
          "startTrigger": { "type": "programStart" }
        },
        {
          "stepId": "trim_rub",
          "name": "Trim shoulder and apply rub",
          "task": "prep",
          "duration": { "type": "fixed", "seconds": 1500 },
          "startTrigger": { "type": "programStart" }
        },
        {
          "stepId": "smoke_unwrapped",
          "name": "Smoke unwrapped (bark phase)",
          "task": "smoker",
          "duration": { "type": "fixed", "seconds": 21600 },
          "startTrigger": { "type": "afterStep", "stepId": "light_smoker" }
        },
        {
          "stepId": "wrap_pork",
          "name": "Wrap in butcher paper",
          "task": "prep",
          "duration": { "type": "fixed", "seconds": 600 },
          "startTrigger": { "type": "afterStep", "stepId": "smoke_unwrapped" }
        },
        {
          "stepId": "smoke_wrapped",
          "name": "Smoke wrapped until probe-tender",
          "task": "smoker",
          "duration": { "type": "variable", "minSeconds": 10800, "maxSeconds": 14400, "defaultSeconds": 10800 },
          "startTrigger": { "type": "afterStep", "stepId": "wrap_pork" }
        },
        {
          "stepId": "hold_cooler",
          "name": "Hold in cooler",
          "task": "cooler",
          "duration": { "type": "variable", "minSeconds": 3600, "maxSeconds": 10800, "defaultSeconds": 5400 },
          "startTrigger": { "type": "afterStep", "stepId": "smoke_wrapped" }
        },
        {
          "stepId": "pull_pork",
          "name": "Pull meat by hand",
          "task": "prep",
          "duration": { "type": "fixed", "seconds": 1800 },
          "startTrigger": { "type": "afterStep", "stepId": "hold_cooler" }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "trackId": "beans",
      "name": "Beans",
      "steps": [
        {
          "stepId": "beans_prep",
          "name": "Fry bacon and onion",
          "task": "side_burner",
          "duration": { "type": "fixed", "seconds": 720 },
          "startTrigger": { "type": "afterStep", "stepId": "hold_cooler" }
        },
        {
          "stepId": "beans_simmer",
          "name": "Simmer beans on low",
          "task": "side_burner",
          "duration": { "type": "indefinite", "defaultSeconds": 3600 },
          "startTrigger": { "type": "afterStep", "stepId": "beans_prep" }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "trackId": "slaw",
      "name": "Slaw",
      "steps": [
        {
          "stepId": "slaw_shred",
          "name": "Shred cabbage and carrot",
          "task": "prep",
          "duration": { "type": "fixed", "seconds": 1200 },
          "startTrigger": { "type": "afterStep", "stepId": "hold_cooler" }
        },
        {
          "stepId": "slaw_dressing",
          "name": "Whisk buttermilk dressing",
          "task": "prep",
          "duration": { "type": "fixed", "seconds": 480 },
          "startTrigger": { "type": "afterStep", "stepId": "slaw_shred" }
        },
        {
          "stepId": "slaw_dress_chill",
          "name": "Dress slaw and chill",
          "task": "cooler",
          "duration": { "type": "fixed", "seconds": 2700 },
          "startTrigger": { "type": "afterStep", "stepId": "slaw_dressing" }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "trackId": "grill",
      "name": "Grill",
      "steps": [
        {
          "stepId": "light_grill",
          "name": "Light kettle grill and build coals",
          "task": "kettle_grill",
          "duration": { "type": "fixed", "seconds": 1500 },
          "startTrigger": { "type": "programStartOffset", "offsetSeconds": 3600 }
        },
        {
          "stepId": "grill_sausages",
          "name": "Grill sausages",
          "task": "kettle_grill",
          "duration": { "type": "fixed", "seconds": 840 },
          "startTrigger": { "type": "afterStep", "stepId": "light_grill" }
        },
        {
          "stepId": "grill_corn",
          "name": "Grill corn",
          "task": "kettle_grill",
          "duration": { "type": "fixed", "seconds": 600 },
          "startTrigger": { "type": "afterStep", "stepId": "grill_sausages" }
        },
        {
          "stepId": "toast_buns",
          "name": "Toast buns",
          "task": "kettle_grill",
          "duration": { "type": "fixed", "seconds": 180 },
          "startTrigger": { "type": "afterStep", "stepId": "grill_corn" }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "trackId": "service",
      "name": "Service",
      "steps": [
        {
          "stepId": "set_table",
          "name": "Set out plates, pickles, sauce",
          "task": "prep",
          "duration": { "type": "fixed", "seconds": 600 },
          "startTrigger": { "type": "afterStep", "stepId": "toast_buns" }
        },
        {
          "stepId": "final_layout",
          "name": "Final layout and call to table",
          "task": "prep",
          "duration": { "type": "fixed", "seconds": 300 },
          "startTrigger": { "type": "afterStep", "stepId": "set_table" }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "resourceConstraints": [
    { "task": "smoker", "maxConcurrent": 1 },
    { "task": "kettle_grill", "maxConcurrent": 1 },
    { "task": "side_burner", "maxConcurrent": 1 },
    { "task": "cooler", "maxConcurrent": 1 },
    { "task": "prep", "maxConcurrent": 2 }
  ],
  "metadata": {
    "serves": "12",
    "attribution": "Backyard Barbecue instructions"
  }
}
```

This program captures:
- **Pork dominates the smoker** from light through both smoke phases (the critical path).
- **Beans and slaw** both start when pork enters the cooler (t ≈ 9.5 hours), running in parallel on the side burner and prep station.
- **Grill lights 1 hour before service** (offset from start) to finish corn, sausages and buns in sequence.
- **Service layers after buns** are toasted.
- **Two cooks** handle parallel prep tasks (shredding, dressing, pulling) without conflicts.
- **Cooler holds pork and chills slaw** sequentially (maxConcurrent: 1).

The makespan is ~12.5 hours (smoker time dominates); beans simmer indefinitely and are ended by the user when everything else is plated. The live URL and Gantt will appear when you call `visualize_schedule` with this JSON.
